<title>UK: Clubpartners says may receive offer.</title>
<headline>Clubpartners says may receive offer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Clubpartners International Plc said on Tuesday that it is in talks which might lead to an offer being made for the company.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the talks are with &quot;a leading industry operator,&quot; and if terms are agreed the offer price for the ordinary shares will be in the region of 1p per share.</p>
<p>Clubpartners operates golf and leisure facilities.</p>
<p>By 1425 GMT, shares in the company had fallen 5p to 2-1/2.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
